{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And they went down.</b> These were swallowed up more than the two hundred and fifty men, because they accepted Moses' words when he said, 'and bring each man his firepan — two hundred and fifty firepens.' But Korah, Dathan, and Abiram did not accept his words, as I explained above, that they said, 'we will not go up.' Therefore they were cast out in a worse manner than was done to any creature."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:18:19.200249965Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}